Package: heartbeatDetector
Title: QRS Complex Detection for Single-Channel Signals
Version: 0.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ana", "Fraile", , "ana.frailecaparros@usp.ceu.es", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Implements a slope-based algorithm for detecting QRS complexes in a 
    single-channel ECG signal. The algorithm is based on the SQRS detector from 
    the WFDB toolkit. The original SQRS algorithm was based on the work of Engelse 
    and Zeelenberg, “A single scan algorithm for QRS detection and feature extraction,” 
    Computers in Cardiology, 1979.
